Warning [L0530] (redundant_final_return): An explicit `return` is used on the final value line
  --> cost_hidden_in_loop.jet:5:5
    |
  5 |     return Val(0)
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: An unadorned expression on the final value line is Jet's implicit return; `return` is for early exits
 Fix: Remove the final `return` and leave the expression as the block tail
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0530

Warning [L2510] (hidden_cost_in_loop): This copy of `String (text)` view into an owned slot repeats inside a loop.
  --> cost_hidden_in_loop.jet:12:34
    |
 12 |     loop _ in 0..<3 -> &out.push(view)
    |                                  ^^^^
 Why: A repeated copy or representation fallback can make a growing value's cost super-linear.
 Fix: Insert `~` before the highlighted expression to make the copy explicit.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L2510
